			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Cocoon and Mountain submodules\n\nRoutine submodule synchronization bringing in latest changes across the application stack:\n\n1. Mountain (1c3dd9e7):\n   - Implement ConfigurationTarget handling in UpdateValue.rs:\n     - UserLocal → User settings.json (no sync backend)\n     - WorkspaceFolder → <folder>/.vscode/settings.json\n     - Memory → in-memory only\n     - Default/Policy → read-only errors per spec\n   - Revert binary/lib names from verbose dev identifier back to \"Mountain\"\n   - Simplify Tauri identifier to \"land.editor.binary\"\n   - Remove duplicate externalBin entry and obsolete .Backup files\n\n2. Cocoon (fe5463b3): Submodule sync to latest extension host changes.\n\nImpact: Mountain now fully implements ConfigurationProvider trait for all VS Code configuration targets, enabling extensions to persist settings to user preferences, workspace .vscode folders, and in-memory session state. Extension host updated to latest.",
